Package: finalproject
Title: BST 260 Final Project
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Iris",
           family = "Chen",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "yirongchen@hsph.harvard.edu",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0000-8397-6911"))
Description: Contains public health datasets and documentation for the BST 260
    final project. The project compares the share of reported foodborne and
    waterborne outbreaks that began in summer from 2009 to 2019. It also examines
    changes in age-adjusted homicide mortality rates across U.S. states and the
    District of Columbia between 2017-2019 and 2022-2024. The accompanying
    website presents the analyses, findings, and limitations.
